 <title>Photographic contest</title>
 <link>http://2012.drupalcamp.es/en/photographic-contest-174</link>
 <description>
  &lt;div class=&quot;field-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;During the celebration of the Drupal Camp Spain 2012, we will organize a photographic contest of the event. ¡All the attendees are invited to participate!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Is really easy to participate and you only need to meet the next conditions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1.- Be one of the attendees of the Drupal Camp 2012.&lt;br /&gt;
2.- Take your picture during the event. The only valid pictures will be the ones sent from the opening of the Camp until the lunch time on Sunday.&lt;br /&gt;
3.- The picture must be related with the event.&lt;br /&gt;
4.- Tweet the picture with the hashtag #FotosDCSpain2012&lt;br /&gt;
5.- You can send as much pictures as you want.&lt;br /&gt;
6.- The organizers keep the right to remove any picture from the contest.&lt;br /&gt;
7.- You keep all the rights of the picture, we only request to give us permission to use it to promote our events and the AED.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if it&#039;s not necessary, we would like to have a centralized place with all the pictures of the event. Please, upload the pictures to our &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.flickr.com/groups/2118152@N21/&quot;&gt;Flickr group&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The winner will be chosen during the closing session of the Drupal Camp. The winner will get a price!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good luck to all!&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
